\subsection{Sensitivity checks}\label{sec:sens}
Dropping ties from Arena-55k changes $\Delta$ to $\noTiesDel$ (deletion) and $\noTiesFlip$ [$\noTiesFlipLo$, $\noTiesFlipHi$] (flip): the positive departure of Arena outcome flips from the null is tied to the treatment of ties as half a win. For MT-Bench the turn-1 and turn-2 halves have six and seven pairs and are undecided at the margin (largest upper bound of $\Delta$ for GPT-4 deletion: $\mtTurnDelMax$). Appendix Table~\ref{tab:sens} gives all checks.
